### 1. Gem et billede for en eksisterende bruger (sørg for at userId matcher en bruger i din DB)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/images/save
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579783902614-a3fb3927b675",
  "externalId": "abc-123-unsplash",
  "title": "Abstract Painting",
  "source": "Unsplash",
  "userId": 1
}

### Hent alle gemte billeder fra bruger
GET {{host}}/api/v1/images/user/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Fejltest: Prøv at gemme et billede for en bruger der IKKE findes
